Umme Laila Yeh Kheti Thi Rokar Meri Duniya Ujaadh Gayi Akber<br>
Kaise Jee Payengi Teri Madar Meri Duniya Ujaadh Gayi Akber<br>
<br>
1.Laaye Shabbir Jab Tera Laasha<br>
Waqt Muhjpar Tha Wo Qayamath Ka<br>
Tar Ba Tar Khoon Me Tujhe Dekha<br>
Hai Nighahou Me Abhi Wo Manzar<br>
Meri Duniya Ujaadh Gayi Akber<br>
<br>
2.Gham Zada Haaye saniye Zehra<br>
Tujhku Aathraha Saal Paala Tha<br>
Main Samjhti Hu Haal Zainab Ka<br>
Meri Duniya Ujaadh Gayi Akber<br>
<br>
3.Qaid Hokar Chala Hai Yun Kunba<br>
Bewatan Berida Rasan Basta<br>
Bekafan Run Me Hai Tera Laasha<br>
Samne Sar Hai Nouke Naiza Par<br>
Meri Duniya Ujaadh Gayi Akber<br>
<br>
4.Shamme Furkhat Ki Law Badhati Hai<br>
Jab Sada-e-Azaan Aati Hai<br>
Yaad teri Bhot Rulati Hai<br>
Fakhre Yousuf Shabihe Paighambar<br>
Meri Duniya Ujaadh Gayi Akber <br>
<br>
5.Tha Yeh Arman Teri Shaadi Ho<br>
Ghar Me Laun Main Teri Dulhan Ko<br>
Tum Bhi Aulad Ki Khushi dekho<br>
Har Tamanna Pe Chalgaya Khanjar<br>
Meri Duniya Ujaadh Gayi Akber<br>
<br>
6.Tere Seene Pe Jo Laagi Barchi<br>
Mere Dil Par Wo Zakhm Hai Abhi<br>
Qabr Me Bhi Bhot Rulayengi<br>
Mujhku teri Judaai Aye Dilbar<br>
Meri Duniya Ujaadh Gayi Akber<br>
<br>
7.Ghar Ki Wareeniou Ka Matam Hai<br>
Yehin Sughra Ka Gham Se Alaam Hai<br>
Tere Nakhsh-e-Khadam Pe Sar Kham Hai<br>
Padhrahi Hai Yeh Nouha Rorokar<br>
<br>
8.Karwan-e-Aza Ka Hai Wada<br>
Ta Abad Yeh Kamal Gham Honga<br>
Royenge Yaad Karke Wo Nouha<br>
Umr Bhar Tha Jo Maa Ke Houthou Par<br>
Meri Duniya Ujaadh Gayi Akber
